- other documentary evidence including, but not limited to, media articles; scholarly journals; expert evidence (i.e., evidence from a person who is a specialist in a subject and who may present an “expert” opinion).

## 7.11. Obtaining evidence for A36(1)(a)

The officer may obtain evidence for A36(1)(*a*) by collecting:

