- client ID;
- *Notice to Transporter* form [BSF502];
- cost of the removal order;
- copy of the deferral of examination, if applicable;
- copy of the passport, emergency travel document, residence card and any transit visa(s);
- original or photocopy of the airline ticket and itinerary;
- airline security approval;
- notice of removal;
- notice of seizure;
