(e) a summary of the legal argument to be made in support of the constitutional challenge According to RADR 25(3) the party must provide:
(a) a copy of the notice to the Attorney General of Canada and the attorney general of each province of Canada, in accordance with section 57 of the *Federal Court Act*;
(b) a copy of the notice to the Minister even if the Minister has not yet intervened in the appeal;
