National Headquarers in Ottawa is responsible for: 

- preparing national policies and guidelines for program delivery; 

- producing and maintaining operational manuals; 

- providing coordinated functional guidance and support to the regional and local CIC offices; 

- engagement and communication with stakeholders; 

