- letters of reference from previous employers. Applicants must also provide proof of fulltime employment, including proof that the mandatory deductions of that country have been paid. For example, in the Philippines, employers are required by law to pay monthly contributions to Philhealth and Social Security System for all employees without exception. Proof of contributions made is adequate proof that the employee was paid for this employment; OR 

